{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311430","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231143001:1":{"text":"솔직히 말해도 되나요?","source_cn":"你想听实话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F23BEC2B701FF41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231143002:1":{"text":"우리는 상도덕을 지키면서 장사를 하거든요. 물을 섞어야 할 때는 섞고 있어요. 순도 높은 독주는 없고요.","source_cn":"我们讲究的就是一个童叟无欺，该掺水就掺水，纯度高的烈性...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDC8F69E02825099","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231143003:1":{"text":"술꾼들이 여기에 오는 이유는 명확해요. 그들은 취하고 싶어 하지만 그만큼 돈을 낼 능력은 없어요.","source_cn":"大多酒客来这里的目的很明确，他们期待烂醉，但又掏不起钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7626B338FC7F0BFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231143004:1":{"text":"그러니 사장님은 그들이 돈을 낸 만큼 술을 내어주는 거고요.","source_cn":"我们老板保证，他们付出的和得到的一定等价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC835E821E70AF104","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍者奇卡瓦":{"text":"사환 치카바","source":"侍者奇卡瓦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}